OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 35, in court charged with
OL,4,Amurder of Carrie Mullane
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 35-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with the murder of missing
OL,8,FLimerick woman Carrie Mullane (Noonan).
OL,10,FMullane, 39, has been missing since she
OL,11,Farrived in Enniskillen from Limerick on
OL,12,F10 October 2026.
OL,14,FMichael Lynch, of Trasna Park in
OL,15,FEnniskillen appeared via video link
OL,16,Fbefore Dungannon Magistrates' Court on
OL,17,FSaturday morning.
OL,19,FThe 35-year-old man is also charged
OL,20,Fwith preventing lawful burial. He
OL,21,Fconfirmed he understood the charges
OL,22,Fagainst him.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
